l with docker that people need to change the unix_socket path in their setup to /var/run/headscale.socket\r\n\r\nI personally prefer the first option as we would revert an unintentional breaking change of a default value. @kradalby Do you have any opinion on that? Or was this change necessary and I don't see why it was necessary? ","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/1535628681/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ohdearaugustin","id":14001491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDAxNDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14001491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin","html_url":"https://github.com/ohdearaugustin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":9173056671,"node_id":"MEE_lADOEFLz885lAtVezwAAAAIiwbyf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/9173056671","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_